    "caption": "Meet Our Speaker: Vrijraj Singh! 🔥\n\nIn this session and workshop, Vrijraj will explore how to integrate Generative AI with Firebase to build a full-stack web application. \n\nHe’ll cover key Firebase services, including Firebase Genkit for AI capabilities, Firebase Auth for secure authentication, and Cloud Firestore for real-time data storage. \n\nBy the end of the session, you will have the skills to create and deploy a fully functional AI-powered web application using Firebase.\n\n📅 Date & Time: April 20 at 15:00\n📍 Location: Mangystau Hub\n🗣 Language: English\n🎟 Registration: To participate, you need to fill out two forms – Google Form and RSVP on the community website.\n\nDon’t miss out!🤘",
